title Expense Claim Application

component expense-webapp as "Expense Claims" web-application
component expense-api as "Expense API" service
component expense-claims-db as "Expense Claims DB" database
component receipt-agent as "Receipt Extraction Agent" ai-agent

east thunder-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south aws-s3 as "Receipt Storage (S3)" service

north -> expense-webapp

expense-webapp -> expense-api
expense-webapp -> receipt-agent
expense-webapp -> thunder-auth

expense-api -> thunder-auth
expense-api -> expense-claims-db
expense-api -> aws-s3

receipt-agent -> thunder-auth
